%% SQL Query Processing Flow
%% Commit SHA: 6ca473a526d30cccd2d55ea87a6bf4bd22db3e40

sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant CE as ConnExecutor
    participant P as Parser
    participant OB as OptBuilder
    participant O as Optimizer
    participant EB as ExecBuilder
    participant E as Executor
    participant KV as KV Layer

    C->>CE: SQL Query
    CE->>P: Parse(sql)
    P-->>CE: AST

    CE->>OB: Build(ast)
    Note over OB: Name resolution<br/>Type checking<br/>Semantic analysis
    OB-->>CE: Memo

    CE->>O: Optimize()
    Note over O: Normalization rules<br/>Exploration rules<br/>Cost estimation
    O-->>CE: OptExpr

    CE->>EB: Build(optExpr)
    EB-->>CE: Execution Plan

    CE->>E: Execute(plan)

    loop For each operation
        E->>KV: Read/Write
        KV-->>E: Result
    end

    E-->>CE: Results
    CE-->>C: Response
